s deep, aborting normalization"],"code":"514150","payment_type":"upfront","pax_restriction":null,"allocation":"per_passenger"},{"id":532091,"name":"Lake Titicaca Kayak Excursion  - Day 19","value":59,"description":"Begin your journey early in the morning by transfering from the hotel to the port, then head out by motorboat to the base camp at the Peninsula of Capachica, a 2.5 hr trip. Learn about sea kayaking from our guide and paddle towards Taquile Island and enjoy the beauty and serenity of the moment. Hike to a village upon arrival and enjoy lunch with the locals. Continue on by motor boat to Amantani Island to meet your hosts for the night. ","price_tiers":["Over 9 levels deep, aborting normalization"],"code":"514384","payment_type":"upfront","pax_restriction":null,"allocation":"per_passenger"},{"id":644463,"name":"Arequipa City Tour - Day 5","value":45,"description":"Get out and explore \"the white city\" on this walking tour, stop at picturesque viewpoints to capture the surrounding volcanoes, marvel at the white volcanic sillar rock architecture, and visit one of the most stunning colonial buildings in the country, Santa Catalina Monastery.","price_tiers":["Over 9 levels deep, aborting normalization"],"code":"513230","payment_type":"upfront","pax_restriction":null,"allocation":"per_passenger"},{"id":644464,"name":"Flight over Nazca Lines - Day 4","value":122,"description":"Take to the skies for the best view of the enigmatic Nazca Lines, a series of patterns and pictures etched in the ground, crisscrossing a wide area of flat desert. Marvel at the lines measuring up to 10km (6 mi) in length, yet, remaining perfectly straight. See depictions of birds, insects, and animals only recognizable from the air. Decide for yourself the origin of the lines – who drew the lines, and why, remains a mystery. Current beliefs suggest that they may be part of complex agricultural calendar.  

