ict and visit the Dohany Street Synagogue to learn about the history of Hungarian Jews. Today, this area is known for its \"ruin bars\" and is a lively center of nightlife.","price_tiers":["Over 9 levels deep, aborting normalization"],"code":"526579","payment_type":"upfront","pax_restriction":null,"allocation":"per_passenger"},{"id":646541,"name":"Florence Food Tour - Day 3","value":98,"description":"Uncover the treasures of Florence, savoured by locals for generations, on this 3-hour walking tour through Oltrarno. Experience the unique flavours and foods that make the cuisine of this region so distinct from the rest of Italy. Famous for being the birthplace of the Renaissance and home to Michelangelo’s famous statue of David, Florence is a city rich with culture, history and of course, some of the tastiest Tuscan food in the region. Wander the streets and soak up the bohemian vibe as you stop to sample wine and salami. There is even the chance to get hands on as you learn how to make Italian cantucci (cookies).","price_tiers":["Over 9 levels deep, aborting normalization"],"code":"525271","payment_type":"upfront","pax_restriction":null,"allocation":"per_passenger"},{"id":2247354,"name":"Krakow Direct - Auschwitz Tours - Day 11","value":52,"description":"","price_tiers":["Over 9 levels deep, aborting normalization"],"code":"527800","payment_type":"upfront","pax_restriction":null,"allocation":"per_passenger"}],"accommodations":[{"id":646538,"name":"Standard","value":3249,"description":"","price_tiers":["Over 9 levels deep, aborting normalization"],"code":"STANDARD","payment_type":"upfront","pax_restriction":null,"beds_number":null,"is_shared":null}]}},"cheapestAccommodation":null,"tour_id":"76006"},{"id":772731158,"date":"2025-06-24","availability":15,"departure_type":"guaranteed","guide_languages":[1],"links":[{"type":"book-now","url":"https://www.stage.tourradar.com/book-now/76006?utm_source=partner-vibe-adventures&utm_medium=api&utm_campaign=book&date=24.06.2025"}]